step To the Scarlet Monastery
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Four dungeons for five players, each its own wing with its own door in the monastery's courtyard: the Graveyard (levels 30 to 38), the Library (33 to 41), the Armory (36 to 44) and the Cathedral (38 to 46).
  enter "Scarlet Monastery" @82.6,33.8

